la Yourcenar,

00:12:46.748 --> 00:12:48.648
Giovanotti,

00:12:50.694 --> 00:12:52.697
Fernanda Pivano,

00:12:55.820 --> 00:12:57.466
Erri De Luca,

00:12:59.158 --> 00:13:01.128
Hitchcock,

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:06.238
Patti Smith,

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.835
Einstein,

00:13:10.543 --> 00:13:12.309
Monica Vitti,

00:13:15.786 --> 00:13:17.645
Mandela,

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.540
Baudelaire,

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:24.552
