00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:28.285
la signora Levi-Montalcini,

00:13:31.715 --> 00:13:33.620
Mick Jagger,

00:13:36.082 --> 00:13:38.051
Gae Aulenti,

00:13:39.435 --> 00:13:41.817
